---
import WorkGlyph from "./WorkGlyph.astro";
---

<div class="workflow-visual" aria-label="Примерен процес от входяща задача до завършена работа">
  <div class="workflow-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg class="workflow-path" viewBox="0 0 760 350" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="flow-gradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#2de2d0" />
        <stop offset=".5" stop-color="#8f7cff" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#ff8d72" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <path d="M74 210 C190 210 178 88 310 88 S430 268 556 268 S616 150 700 150" />
    <path class="workflow-path__active" d="M74 210 C190 210 178 88 310 88 S430 268 556 268 S616 150 700 150" />
  </svg>

  <div class="flow-node flow-node--input">
    <span class="flow-node__icon"><WorkGlyph name="vdiga" /></span>
    <small>Вход</small><strong>Нова задача</strong><span>телефон · имейл · сайт</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-node flow-node--route">
    <span class="flow-node__icon"><WorkGlyph name="route" /></span>
    <small>Разпределяне</small><strong>Кой служител я поема?</strong><span>според източника и задачата</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-node flow-node--guard">
    <span class="flow-node__icon"><WorkGlyph name="guard" /></span>
    <small>Одобрение</small><strong>Нужно ли е човек?</strong><span>плащане и публикуване чакат</span>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-node flow-node--done">
    <span class="flow-node__icon"><WorkGlyph name="result" /></span>
    <small>Резултат</small><strong>Работата е записана</strong><span>какво е направено и кога</span>
  </div>

  <div class="workflow-note"><span>Примерен работен поток</span><strong>Автоматизация с човешка граница</strong></div>
</div>
